(49,96,100,'1704',1704,'The e-rara object record and searchable scan locate John Harris''s dictionary definition of algorithm.','Volume 1, unnumbered leaf [51], entry ALGORITHM; e-rara generated scan PDF','ALGORITHM, sometimes called Logistica Numeralis, is the Sum of the Principal Rules of Numeral Computation.','probable','printed_book','ETH-Bibliothek Zürich','Rar 98 Ex.A GF','https://www.e-rara.ch/download/pdf/2926852.pdf',0,'The catalog record, repository OCR, and exact locator were checked, but the page image itself could not be opened for visual inspection. This candidate is not promoted as directly inspected and is not claimed as the earliest surviving English use.'),
(50,113,101,'1923',1923,'The photographed English title page prints the plural headword in “Rossum''s Universal Robots.”','Title-page spread, title line “R.U.R. (Rossum''s Universal Robots)”','R.U.R. (ROSSUM''S UNIVERSAL ROBOTS)','established','printed_book','Bibliothèque nationale de France — BnF Essentiels image record','Image record 77285f7f-de94-4bb0-94f4-0d3b95405373','https://cdn.essentiels.bnf.fr/media/images/cache/crop/rc/pvMicQiZ/uploads/media/image/20240308095039000000_4_22.jpg',1,'Directly inspected title-page occurrence in a photographed 1923 English edition. This object verifies “Robots” in the title of this edition; it is not claimed as the first English use and does not verify unpictured pages of the play.');
